  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tbsp of oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add scotch bonnet peppers and cook until fragrant, about 1 min.",
    "Add the diced red onion and celery, cook until they start to soften, about 3 min.",
    "Add the cod and cook until it's opaque and flaky, about 4 min.",
    "Add the miso paste and almond essence, stir to combine, about 1 min.",
    "Push the cod mixture to one side of the pan and add more oil if needed.",
    "Add the brown rice to the empty side of the pan and stir-fry for 2-3 min.",
    "Combine the rice with the cod mixture and stir-fry for 2-3 min.",
    "Stir in the coconut milk and cook for an additional 2-3 min.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and sesame seeds, and serve immediately.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning with salt and black pepper as needed."
  ],
